"file_name": "ScreenshotHighRes6.png", "id": "1262435838228048", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974631_1262435841561381_3311224200131038151_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z0SLDoTbUsQQ7kNvwFTlOK_&_nc_oc=Adp7cBOpGPKuY7X0g6OZNBTr-KcMAww02bSvzWqqoaPh7BHCp5Tmb4AJexuOUH0CWtI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2JxqM1V0Nbro1avRiTCXk3YiWG6PDpBHe9Rg2d4f-5AA&oe=69F201FD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "EmatahnCoverHiRes.png", "id": "511241218457028", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575352_511241221790361_760251907399571310_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FizGO2PZ0fIQ7kNvwEk9PN8&_nc_oc=Adr-BJQNweLSTOC84_yQrz-SnqUXRHor6F2sslLRn_Uo_b85yLsvvK_Xm9qDyoj4tAM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3TkPF6_7SKzJJl46Yig9jEchgce56a7zFlsXZq1R_DCg&oe=69F20992"}, "display_name": "Legend of the Ematahn", "keywords": ["Action", "Adventure", "Physics", "Combat", "Magic"], "long_description": "# Embark on a new adventure!\n\nAs you're beginning to make friends with a nearby village, a new group emerges that threatens the stability of the Highlands. Legend of the Ematahn is an action adventure game featuring physics based combat, magic, an original story, and a world waiting to be explored. Complete quests for the different factions of the Highlands. Uncover a history of conflict and defend the people against threats of all kind. Are you up to the challenge?\n\n# Features\n\n* An original story with 18 unique quests.\n* A physics based combat system with magic.\n* VR climbing and platforming quests.\n* Boss fights.\n* 5 different factions with unique characters and dialog.\n* Survival mode with 6 different maps.\n* More to be added in future updates!", "short_description": "Embark on a new adventure! Legend of the Ematahn is an action adventure game featuring physics based combat, magic, an original story, and a world waiting to be e